
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>My Resume</title>
    <style>
        /* Simple CSS styles */
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 20px;
            color: #333;
            background-color: #fff;
        }

        /* Photo styling */
        .photo {
            width: 120px;
            height: 120px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            object-fit: cover;
            display: block;
            margin: 0 auto 20px auto;
        }

        header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: #2c3e50;
        }

        .contact-info {
            margin-top: 10px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #555;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            color: #2c3e50;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #eee;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .job-title, .school {
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        .date {
            color: #777;
            font-style: italic;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        ul {
            padding-left: 20px;
        }

        li {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <!-- Replace src with your image file -->
        <img src="https://photolive.in/whatsapp-dp/" alt="Your Name" class="photo">
        <h1>John Snow</h1>
        <div class="contact-info">
            <p>john.doe@email.com | (555) 123-4567 | New York, NY</p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section>
        <h2>Summary</h2>
        <p>Dedicated professional with experience in project management and team leadership. Committed to delivering high-quality results and solving complex problems efficiently.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>Experience</h2>
        
        <div class="job">
            <div class="job-title">Project Manager</div>
            <div class="date">Company Name | 2021 - Present</div>
            <ul>
                <li>Led a team of 10 people to complete projects on time.</li>
                <li>Improved workflow efficiency by 20%.</li>
                <li>Managed budgets exceeding $500k.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="job">
            <div class="job-title">Junior Analyst</div>
            <div class="date">Previous Corp | 2019 - 2021</div>
            <ul>
                <li>Analyzed data trends to support decision making.</li>
                <li>Created weekly reports for senior management.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>Education</h2>
        <div class="edu">
            <div class="school">Bachelor of Science in Business</div>
            <div class="date">University Name | 2015 - 2019</div>
        </div>
    </section>

</body>
</html>
